Vendored from libretro-common (MIT), formats/xml/rxml.c and
include/formats/rxml.h, byte-identical to upstream at the commit named
in the log.  The retro_*/streams headers here are minimal local shims
so the file compiles without the rest of libretro-common; the file
stream functions are stubbed (rxml_filestream_stubs.c) because this
tree only parses from memory.  Resync by copying the two upstream
